    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d547">

                <pb facs="0917" n="870" xml:id="pg870"/>

                <head>547. Telegram 1658 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d547-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1956-03-21">March 21, 1956, 7
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d547-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d547-1"/>
                <p>1658. From Johnson.</p>
                <p>Concur Clough’s memo to McConaughy March 12 that not rpt not desirable ARC
                    attempt by letter seek assistance CHICOM Red Cross release 13. Nicholson should
                    however utilize all possibilities at May meeting to impress on CHICOM Red Cross
                    American concern continued detention 13.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
